From 55424d3b97503176ee596a1ae44748d3c617198c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Cl=C3=A9ment=20Le=20Goffic?= <legoffic.clement@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 11:10:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] arm64: renesas: defconfig: Enable the Ethernet Switch3
 driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

rtsn.c now calls rswitch3_attach_tsnes() and rswitch3_detach_tsnes()
unconditionally, and rswitch3.h declares them without providing stubs
when the driver is disabled.
The defconfig enables RTSN but not RENESAS_ETHER_SWITCH3, so vmlinux
fails to link.
Enable the switch driver to resolve the symbols.

Signed-off-by: Clément Le Goffic <clegoffic@baylibre.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/renesas_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/renesas_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/renesas_defconfig
index c4eb06da6986..fc8a71d08cc1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/renesas_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/renesas_defconfig
@@ -149,6 +149,7 @@ CONFIG_VIRTIO_NET=y
 CONFIG_SH_ETH=y
 CONFIG_RAVB=y
 CONFIG_RENESAS_ETHER_SWITCH=y
+CONFIG_RENESAS_ETHER_SWITCH3=y
 CONFIG_RTSN=y
 CONFIG_STMMAC_ETH=y
 # CONFIG_DWMAC_GENERIC is not set
-- 
2.43.0

